From 72f33e58bb5eea5b0f74b0dd62ef40d072dc6598 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: memra-lane <lane@localhost>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 21:19:19 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] dsv4: dense class gate plus paired dense accuracy driver
 (unmerged instrument)

dsv4-dense-class-gate runs the #534 drift shape (top-1 counts, KL mean/max
both directions, greedy identity) scalar-vs-cutlass, A/B/B/A per panel, with
split-K plus device-crossing engagement and a no-all-equal-refusal rationale.
dsv4-dense-accuracy pairs greedy outputs per item in one process, chunked-32
prime (the only engaging width), with per-arm rows.jsonl plus item texts in
the frozen scorers' shape. Instruments for the default verdict; not for merge
until the verdict says so.

Signed-off-by: memra-lane <lane@localhost>
