Subject: [PATCH 2/2] dsv4: allocate width-32 decode state in
 dsv4-dense-accuracy

Chunked prime at width 32 is refused against a width-1 allocation before any
row runs (seen firsthand on the box: dsv4 prefill chunk 32 outside 1..=1).
PRIME_WIDTH names the one engaging width in both places.

Signed-off-by: memra-lane <lane@localhost>
